      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can see this kind of thing being abused by both world creators and vrchat users. World creators would start listing their worlds as 18+ even if they don't feature any content that would require the age restriction. And all users, even those under 18, would list themselves as above the age restriction so they'd be able to access the world(s).",
