  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-31T20:47:27.963Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Have a private age variable on somebody's account which is not visible to anyone.  So when called by Udon the world creator can check if the user is over 18+ or not (Vague information never their specific age just over 18+ or not). This will allow them to access certain parts of a world if they are.  This method will not violate privacy and keep younger audiences safe.  World creators can even use this method to separate 18+ users from 18- users in certain worlds.  This is something that could significantly help world developers.",
